WEBVTT

asr-000041
00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:29.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Today's briefing, the briefing of the fiscal year 2027 proposed expenditure

asr-000042
00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:48.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: program of the Office of the Vice President is now called to order. I would like to acknowledge the presence of our Senate President Win, and likewise Senator Imee Marcos. Thank you for attending today's hearing. I would like to ask the Committee Secretary to acknowledge the resource persons present for today.

asr-000042-split-2
00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:59.980
Committee Secretary: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Good morning. Good morning also to our Senate President and Senator Marcos. For the briefing on the proposed FY 2027 budget of the Office of the Vice President, I would like to acknowledge our resource persons from

asr-000043
00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:29.980
Committee Secretary: the OVP. We have Attorney Zuleica Lopez, Assistant Secretary Lemwel Ortono, Attorney Rosely Sanchez, Attorney Sunshine Chari Faarda, Director Norman Baloro, Attorney Emily Rose Torentira, Attorney Kelvin Jerome Pe[unclear], Miss Julieta Villed Rey, Mr. Ard Eje, and Mr. Simon Jezer Lao. We have also invited representatives from the DBM and COA. From DBM, we have Assistant Director Lulu Vispo, Miss Lorian Jaivier, Mr.

asr-000044
00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:40.120
Committee Secretary: George Catalan, Mr. Edward J. Perales, and Miss Queen Valerie Macaspak. For COA, we have Mr. Fahad bin Abdul Malik Tumawis and Miss Zara Jane Tegalan. Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000044-split-2
00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:59.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, our Committee Secretary. Ladies, gentlemen, honorable colleagues in the Senate, guests and resource persons to the Office of the Vice President, a pleasant morning to everyone as we open today's budget hearing of the proposed 2027 budget of the OVP. We recognize the vital role of the Office of the Vice President as a platform for public

asr-000045
00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:29.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: service through socioeconomic and support programs. Being the second highest executive office of the Philippine government, it shall maintain outstanding delivery of its local programs, dignified international networks and resilient sustainable solutions to the countrywide challenges. For this budget deliberation, we endeavor to efficiently utilize the fiscal resources to meet short and long-term projections, strengthen national readiness and enhance responsiveness to the needs of the

asr-000046
00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:59.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Filipino people. Moving forward, this representation acknowledges the tradition of interparliamentary courtesy in respect to the Office of the Vice President, while also assuring the public that the fiscal year 2027 proposed expenditure is taken up with due diligence. Thank you very much. So, before we proceed, I would like to ask our Senate President if he has any remarks.

asr-000047
00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:00.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000048
00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:12.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, binabasa ko itong budget ng OVP and nakita ko na compared to last year, it went down by 11%.

asr-000049
00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:21.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It went down by approximately from P889 million to P785 million.

asr-000050
00:22:23.920 --> 00:22:29.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And nakita ko rin na ang kanilang main program ay yung social...

asr-000051
00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:38.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: social economic program na tumutulong sa ating mga constituents.

asr-000052
00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:42.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I saw various components of that program.

asr-000053
00:22:42.820 --> 00:22:54.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So with that, nakita ko na the Office of the Vice President is spending their budget as efficiently, as wisely as possible.

asr-000054
00:22:55.440 --> 00:22:59.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Of course, bilang Vice President, meron din silang mga...

asr-000055
00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: kailangan tulungan.

asr-000056
00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:06.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Bilang kayo, mga politicians, marami talagang lumalapit sa amin.

asr-000057
00:23:07.100 --> 00:23:10.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'm sure kay Vice President, marami rin lumalapit ang humingi ng tulong.

asr-000058
00:23:11.380 --> 00:23:21.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At itong social economic program will be a tool for her to help her constituents, or our constituents for that matter,

asr-000059
00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:26.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: para mabigyan naman ng relief yung ating mga constituents.

asr-000060
00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:28.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So I only have one question.

asr-000061
00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:34.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Atty. Zulaika, bilang Chief of Staff, may I know where is the Vice President?

asr-000062
00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:46.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Traditionally kasi pag ganitong mga budget deliberation, the Head of Office comes here to defend their budget.

asr-000063
00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:50.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Alam mo naman yan. You've been here for the last four years.

asr-000064
00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:57.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And traditionally, even last year when I was the Chairman of the Finance Committee,

asr-000065
00:23:58.760 --> 00:24:02.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: the Vice President took time to come here to defend her budget.

asr-000066
00:24:02.480 --> 00:24:07.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So may I know, for the record, kung nasaan ang ating butihing Vice President?

asr-000067
00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:09.240
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Yes. Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-000068
00:24:09.240 --> 00:24:10.600
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Good morning, ladies and gentlemen.

asr-000069
00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:19.020
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: The Vice President is actually representing former President Rodrigo Roa Duterte

asr-000070
00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:25.520
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: in the inurnment of our long-serving city planner in Davao City.

asr-000071
00:24:25.980 --> 00:24:28.740
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: So the schedule for the inurnment  is today, October 20.

asr-000072
00:24:28.760 --> 00:24:32.260
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: So she's the representative of the former President.

asr-000073
00:24:34.140 --> 00:24:37.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Is that in the country or outside of the country?

asr-000074
00:24:37.200 --> 00:24:38.220
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Just in the country, Your Honor.

asr-000075
00:24:38.220 --> 00:24:39.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Just in the country.

asr-000076
00:24:39.420 --> 00:24:51.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Well, we hope that sa plenary, we would welcome her presence to further defend her budget.

asr-000077
00:24:51.520 --> 00:24:52.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: This is the first step.

asr-000078
00:24:52.480 --> 00:24:54.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Alam mo naman yan, may second step pa tayo, which is plenary.

asr-000080
00:24:55.480 --> 00:24:58.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And we would hope that she can give time.

asr-000081
00:24:58.760 --> 00:25:02.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We would hope that she can give time to represent her office and defend her budget in plenary.

asr-000082
00:25:03.340 --> 00:25:03.820
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000083
00:25:03.840 --> 00:25:09.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But at this time, during the committee level, I'll leave it to our Chairman,

asr-000084
00:25:09.500 --> 00:25:13.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: who is the one spearheading the budget of the entire bureaucracy.

asr-000085
00:25:13.880 --> 00:25:23.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So I'll leave the shepherding to him on the budget of the OVP.

asr-000086
00:25:23.540 --> 00:25:25.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So with that, Mr. Chairman, maraming salamat.

asr-000087
00:25:26.740 --> 00:25:28.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, our Senate President.

asr-000088
00:25:28.760 --> 00:25:31.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Likewise, the Chair would like to acknowledge the presence of Senator Bong Go.

asr-000089
00:25:32.080 --> 00:25:36.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At this point, I'd like to open the floor to our colleagues if there are any questions for the OVP.

asr-000090
00:25:37.860 --> 00:25:38.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, Senator Marcos.

asr-000091
00:25:39.260 --> 00:25:40.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, Chairman.

asr-000092
00:25:40.480 --> 00:25:46.380
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Thank you very much and welcome to the Office of the Vice President, to the halls of the Senate.

asr-000093
00:25:46.380 --> 00:25:58.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At gusto ko lang sumali dun sa sinabi ng ating mahal na Chairman, si JV, na i-extend na lang yung traditional courtesy natin.

asr-000094
00:25:58.760 --> 00:26:06.580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sa ating mga executive offices, as we do, to the other house, the House of Representatives.

asr-000095
00:26:07.340 --> 00:26:14.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At kahit wala rito ang Pangulo, kahit wala yung pangalawang Pangulo, e talagang namang hinahayaan.

asr-000096
00:26:14.140 --> 00:26:19.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Higit sa lahat, nabawasan pa yung budget ninyo ng higit sa 11%.

asr-000097
00:26:19.040 --> 00:26:25.760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kaya't ang tanging tanong ko na lamang is maliban dun sa sinasabing mga...

asr-000098
00:26:28.760 --> 00:26:32.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Socio-economic programs, ano ba talaga ang mababawasan?

asr-000099
00:26:33.140 --> 00:26:39.760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi alam ko maraming tulong, ako yung nakasama sa mag-negosyo-taday na iba't-ibang mga opening ninyo.

asr-000100
00:26:40.160 --> 00:26:44.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano ang matatamaan at mapeperwisyo ba yung mga beneficiaries natin?

asr-000101
00:26:46.380 --> 00:26:54.760
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: At the outset, Your Honor, much of the budget is really because there is a reprogramming or recalibration of our programs.

asr-000102
00:26:55.260 --> 00:26:58.740
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: One good example could be, as you mentioned, the mag-negosyo-taday.

asr-000103
00:26:58.760 --> 00:27:09.020
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: This year, we're concentrating on monitoring and evaluation and checking if it actually has made impact, this particular program.

asr-000104
00:27:09.160 --> 00:27:16.340
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Therefore, we have identified a reduced number of beneficiaries and target beneficiaries for the year.

asr-000105
00:27:16.760 --> 00:27:21.680
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Another example could be, maybe we can have our Director for Operations, Pagbabago.

asr-000106
00:27:21.860 --> 00:27:27.180
OVP Director Norman Baloro: Thank you, Yusek. Madam Chair, this is with regard to our Pagbabago a Million Learners campaign.

asr-000107
00:27:27.180 --> 00:27:36.280
OVP Director Norman Baloro: We are about to reach already our target, which is 1 million learners to be given with the Pagbabago bags, with raincoats and dental kits as well.

asr-000108
00:27:36.520 --> 00:27:46.820
OVP Director Norman Baloro: So parang yun na rin po, parang napakasaya na rin po namin dahil hindi naaabot ng 2028, ma-re-reach na rin po namin yung goal namin for the 1 million learners.

asr-000109
00:27:47.140 --> 00:27:52.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Thank you and congratulations on the early attainment of the goals stated, your targets.

asr-000110
00:27:52.480 --> 00:27:56.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At syempre, gusto rin namin malaman dun sa mag-negosyo-taday.

asr-000111
00:27:57.180 --> 00:28:06.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kung ilan dun talaga tuloy-tuloy na nag-negosyo, kasi maganda yung sinasabing nyo, kulang na kulang ang monitoring at evaluation sa buong pamahalaan.

asr-000112
00:28:07.300 --> 00:28:14.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At mahusay naman that we take a step back and assess the success and the accomplishment in our actual projects.

asr-000113
00:28:14.860 --> 00:28:21.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: With that, I move that we endorse the budget of the Vice President to the plenary.

asr-000114
00:28:22.000 --> 00:28:25.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Senator Marcos. But before that, I would like to ask Senator Bong Go.

asr-000115
00:28:27.180 --> 00:28:36.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, good morning po sa lahat ng officials ng OVP. Maraming salamat po sa inyong servisyo, patuloy na servisyo sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-000116
00:28:36.800 --> 00:28:42.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I just want to express my strong support for the proposed budget of the Office of the Vice President.

asr-000117
00:28:42.600 --> 00:28:52.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napansin ko po from 2026 na bawasan pa kayo from 800 million to naging 700 plus na lang million.

asr-000118
00:28:53.420 --> 00:28:54.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ngunit patuloy...

asr-000119
00:28:55.300 --> 00:28:56.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: This year po, napansin ko po...

asr-000120
00:28:57.180 --> 00:29:05.960
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Despite the Office's limited budget, nagkaroon po ang OVP ng mga programang nagbibigay ng tunay na beneficyo sa ating mamamayan.

asr-000121
00:29:06.620 --> 00:29:14.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: From disaster operations, patuloy po ang inyong tulong, pangkabuhayan programs at libring sakay, among others, patuloy po ito.

asr-000122
00:29:14.960 --> 00:29:19.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At napagkasha nyo po ang inyong pondo. Salamat po sa inyong lahat.

asr-000123
00:29:21.200 --> 00:29:27.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: These are just some of the programs of the Office of the Vice President that provide meaningful assistance to our fellow Filipinos.

asr-000124
00:29:27.180 --> 00:29:37.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Despite its annual limited budget, the OVP continues to carry out its mandate and deliver services to those who need them most.

asr-000125
00:29:37.900 --> 00:29:40.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kumusta po inyong libring sakay?

asr-000126
00:29:41.140 --> 00:29:42.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa inyong tuloy-tuloy po ba?

asr-000127
00:29:45.900 --> 00:29:51.100
OVP Director Norman Baloro: Yes, sir. Very operational po yung ating libring sakay.

asr-000128
00:29:51.100 --> 00:29:54.100
OVP Director Norman Baloro: We have nine buses already, sir. It is deployed in...

asr-000129
00:29:54.640 --> 00:29:57.100
OVP Director Norman Baloro: Particularly, we have in EDSA Carousel, Monumento

asr-000130
00:29:57.180 --> 00:29:58.780
OVP Director Norman Baloro: to PITX, we have two buses.

asr-000131
00:29:59.340 --> 00:30:00.020
OVP Director Norman Baloro: We have also two...

asr-000132
00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:02.060
OVP Director Norman Baloro: buses operating in

asr-000133
00:30:02.060 --> 00:30:03.980
OVP Director Norman Baloro: the Commonwealth and Quiapo, it's

asr-000134
00:30:03.980 --> 00:30:05.880
OVP Director Norman Baloro: vice versa. We have also P-TEX to

asr-000135
00:30:05.880 --> 00:30:07.980
OVP Director Norman Baloro: Naic, Cavite, and we have one

asr-000136
00:30:07.980 --> 00:30:09.820
OVP Director Norman Baloro: in Bacolod, one in

asr-000137
00:30:09.820 --> 00:30:11.960
OVP Director Norman Baloro: Cebu City, one in Davao, and

asr-000138
00:30:11.960 --> 00:30:14.100
OVP Director Norman Baloro: one in Tacloban City, Your Honor.

asr-000139
00:30:16.000 --> 00:30:18.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po, at nakikita ko

asr-000140
00:30:18.160 --> 00:30:19.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: maraming natutulungan po ito.

asr-000141
00:30:20.400 --> 00:30:21.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At ako mismo,

asr-000142
00:30:21.760 --> 00:30:23.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nung mga nakaraang taon, ay tayo rin po

asr-000143
00:30:23.900 --> 00:30:25.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sumuporta sa programang

asr-000144
00:30:25.920 --> 00:30:27.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ito. Sana po'y maipagpatuloy

asr-000145
00:30:27.940 --> 00:30:29.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nyo ito. Nakakatulong talaga sa ating mga

asr-000146
00:30:29.600 --> 00:30:31.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kababayan. Sa totoo lamang po,

asr-000147
00:30:31.880 --> 00:30:33.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: inihalal ang Vice President na hindi

asr-000148
00:30:33.660 --> 00:30:35.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: lamang para umupo sa pwesto at maging

asr-000149
00:30:35.800 --> 00:30:37.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: spare tire. Inihalal

asr-000150
00:30:37.980 --> 00:30:39.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: po siya para maging working

asr-000151
00:30:39.440 --> 00:30:41.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Vice President para maglingkod at tumugon

asr-000152
00:30:41.780 --> 00:30:43.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa pangangailangan ng ating mga

asr-000153
00:30:43.600 --> 00:30:45.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kababayan. Lahat po tayo

asr-000154
00:30:45.860 --> 00:30:47.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ay public servants. We are meant

asr-000155
00:30:47.800 --> 00:30:49.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: to serve the Filipino people.

asr-000156
00:30:49.800 --> 00:30:52.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Basic mandate po ang tumulong

asr-000157
00:30:52.140 --> 00:30:53.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: lalo na sa nangangailangan ng social

asr-000158
00:30:53.760 --> 00:30:56.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: services. Salamat

asr-000159
00:30:56.000 --> 00:30:57.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: po sa inyong lahat, despite

asr-000160
00:30:57.660 --> 00:30:59.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: your limited budget, patuloy

asr-000161
00:30:59.700 --> 00:31:01.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kayong nagsiservisyo. Nandito

asr-000162
00:31:01.600 --> 00:31:03.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: lamang po kami, kahit isang boto lamang po

asr-000163
00:31:03.620 --> 00:31:05.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ako para sumuporta po sa

asr-000164
00:31:05.700 --> 00:31:07.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: inyong opisina. Basta

asr-000165
00:31:07.020 --> 00:31:09.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: makakatulong po ng mga programa sa ating

asr-000166
00:31:09.740 --> 00:31:11.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: mga kababayan Pilipino. Lalong-lalo na po

asr-000167
00:31:11.700 --> 00:31:13.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: yung mga mahirap. Salamat po sa inyo.

asr-000168
00:31:14.260 --> 00:31:15.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: With that, Mr. Chair, I second

asr-000169
00:31:15.760 --> 00:31:17.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: the motion to submit and recommend

asr-000170
00:31:17.700 --> 00:31:19.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: to the plenary the proposed budget of

asr-000171
00:31:19.720 --> 00:31:21.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: the OVP for 2027.

asr-000172
00:31:23.360 --> 00:31:23.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes,

asr-000173
00:31:23.740 --> 00:31:25.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we take note of the two

asr-000174
00:31:25.360 --> 00:31:26.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: motions by

asr-000175
00:31:26.580 --> 00:31:29.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Marcos and Senator

asr-000176
00:31:29.120 --> 00:31:29.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Bongo. However,

asr-000177
00:31:30.600 --> 00:31:33.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: it is worth noting that

asr-000178
00:31:33.360 --> 00:31:35.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: among the agencies and departments

asr-000179
00:31:35.360 --> 00:31:37.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: being the chairman of the Committee on Finance

asr-000180
00:31:37.340 --> 00:31:39.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: this year, lahat po talaga

asr-000181
00:31:39.260 --> 00:31:41.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: natural na humingi ng taas

asr-000182
00:31:41.360 --> 00:31:43.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng raise, ng increase

asr-000183
00:31:43.580 --> 00:31:45.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in most

asr-000184
00:31:45.440 --> 00:31:46.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: if not

asr-000185
00:31:46.200 --> 00:31:49.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: majority of the

asr-000186
00:31:49.100 --> 00:31:51.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: departments are appealing

asr-000187
00:31:51.180 --> 00:31:52.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to increase their budgets.

asr-000188
00:31:52.520 --> 00:31:54.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And OBP is just

asr-000189
00:31:54.640 --> 00:31:56.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: one of the departments of the very few.

asr-000190
00:31:56.580 --> 00:31:58.060
